r of birth during 2000--2004\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"** p<0.05 by chi-square test, compared with the referent group.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"survey data were weighted to make them representative of all U.S. children aged 19--35 months\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}